</div>
<h3 class="usa-accordion__heading"><button type="button" class="usa-accordion__button" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="faq-3">How do I adjust conveyor guide rails for different product sizes?</button></h3>
<div id="faq-3" class="usa-accordion__content usa-prose">
